## Freshness ownership (required)

**Orchestrator** owns `dashboard.json` → `projectStateUpdatedAt`.

After **any** edit to canonical project state (`work_items.json`, `release_status.json`, `roadmap.json`, `director_brief.md`, `objectives.json`, substantive `dashboard.json`, `agent_*`, `decisions.md`, substantive `activity.jsonl`):

1. Set `projectStateUpdatedAt` to session completion time (ISO UTC)
2. Run `npm run studio:validate` — fix drift warnings before finishing
3. Run `npm run studio:copy-public` if testing Mission Control locally

Do **not** bump `projectStateUpdatedAt` for inbox/notes-only edits, generated `active_work.json`, or gate/deploy/playtest clocks (those use `lastReleaseGateAt`, `lastDeploymentAt`, `lastHumanPlaytestAt`).

Full rules: `studio/freshness-ownership.md`
